==English==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|wide|screen}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|often|attributive}} A [[screen]] with a wider [[aspect ratio]] than the ordinary 35-millimeter frame, making more effective use of the human [[field of view]] and producing a more [[immersive]] view experience.

